# OpenEdit colour kind: AmigaDOS scripts. MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Dalsin Limited.
name      AmigaDOS script
paths     (S:|SYS:S/|ENVARC:Sys/|DEVS:DOSDrivers/)#?
files     (#?.(script|dos|bat)|(Startup-Sequence|User-Startup|Shell-Startup|Network-Startup|CLI-Startup)#?)
firstline .(key|bra|ket|def|dol|dot|k)#?
case      off
comment   ;
strings   "
escape    *
variable  $
directive .
labels    after LAB SKIP
numbers   on
keywords  IF ELSE ENDIF EQ GT GE NOT WARN ERROR FAIL EXISTS VAL LAB SKIP BACK QUIT ENDSKIP
keywords  ADD REMOVE DEFER PATH LOCK DISMOUNT QUIET ALL FORCE CLONE BUF BUFFERS TO FROM AS
keywords  ON OFF RESET CX_POPUP CX_PRIORITY CX_POPKEY NOREQ NOLINE KEY BRA KET DEF DOL DOT
commands  AddBuffers AddDataTypes Alias Ask Assign Avail Break CD ChangeTaskPri Copy CPU Date
commands  Delete Dir DiskChange Echo Ed Else EndCLI EndIf EndShell Eval Execute FailAt Fault
commands  FileNote Get GetEnv Info IPrefs Join LoadMonDrvs LoadResource LoadWB Lock MakeDir
commands  MakeLink Mount NewCLI NewShell Path Prompt Protect Quit Relabel Rename Resident Run
commands  Search Set SetClock SetDate SetEnv SetFont SetKeyboard SetPatch Shell Skip Sort Stack
commands  Status Type UnAlias UnSet UnSetEnv Version Wait WaitForPort Which Why List Lab Copy
commands  ConClip MountList BindDrivers Install Format DiskCopy Format OpenEdit OpenFiles
